              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka Saulo, ku yaabaire naakigamba eby'okukangisa n'eby'okwita abeegi ba Mukama, yaaza aha munyamurwa omukuru, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaamushaba kuhandiikira sinagogi za Damasiko ebaruha ngu, ku araashangyeyo abarikwikiriza eby'Omuhanda ogwo, yaaba abashaija nari abakazi, abatware Yerusaalemu babohirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.15.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 15:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaabaire naakigyenda, yaahika haihi na Damaisko, omushana ogurikuruga omu iguru gwamujwera gumwehinguririize, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaagwa ahansi, yaahurira eiraka nirimugira riti: Saulo, Saulo, nompiigira ki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaagarukamu ati: Ori oha, Mukama wangye? We ati: Niinye Yesu ou orikuhiiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taatetema ashobeirwe, yaabuuza ati: Mukama wangye, nooyenda ngu ngire nta? Mukama yaamugarukamu ati: Imuka, otaahe omu rurembo, noija kugambirwa ebi oshemereire kukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abashaija abaabire nibagyenda nawe baayemerera bahunami, nibahurira eiraka, kwonka batarikureeba muntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo yaimuka ahansi; ku yaabuurwire amaisho, tiyaahweza kintu; baamukwata omukono, baamutwara Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamarayo ebiro bishatu atarikuhweza, kandi atarikurya n'obu kwakuba okunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Damasiko hakaba hariyo omwegi orikwetwa Anania. Mukama waitu yaamugambira omu kworekwa ati: Anania! Yaamugarukamu ati: Ndi aha, Mukama wangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukama waitu yaamugira ati: Imuka oze omu muhanda ogurikwetwa Ogugororokire, obuuze omu nju ya Yuda omuntu orikwetwa Saulo owa Taruso; ahakuba hati naashaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi areebire omu kworekwa omushaija orikwetwa Anania naija kumutaho engaro ngu ahumuukye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Anania yaagarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, nkahurira baingi nibagamba aha mushaija ogwo, ku yaakozire kubi munonga abarikwera baawe omuri Yerusaalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.22.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 22:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na mbwenu aha aine obushoboorozi, obu aihire aha banyamurwa abakuru, kuboha boona abarikwikiriza eiziina ryawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Mukama yaamugira ati: Irooko ogyende; ahakuba omushaija ogwo n'ekintu kyangye eki ntooraine okutwara eiziina ryangye omu maisho g'Abanyamahanga n'abagabe n'Abaisraeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.11.23+2CO.11.24+2CO.11.25+2CO.11.26+2CO.11.27+2CO.11.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Kor 11:23-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " naanye ndyamworeka obusaasi bwingi obu ashemereire kwemera ahabw'eiziina ryangye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anania nikwo kugyenda, akataaha omu nju egyo; akmutaho engaro, akamugira ati: Ow'eishe-emwe Saulo, Mukama waitu Yesu, okweyorekyeire omu muhanda ogu oreetsirwemu, yantuma ngu ohumuukye, oijure Omwoyo Orikwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho ebintu ebiri nk'ebikoko byamuruga aha maisho, yaahumuuka; yaayemerera, yaabatizibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku yaaherize kurya eby'okurya, yaagarukwamu amaani. Bwanyima yaamara ebiro bikye n'abeegi Damasiko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho yaatandika kugamba Yesu omuri sinagogi, ku ari Omwana wa Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boona abaamuhuriire baatangaara nibagira bati: ogu t'omushaija owaabaire anyangaraza aba Yerusaalemu abaabaire batakira eiziina eryo? Kandi ekyo nikyo kibaire kimureetsire n'aha, ngu abatware babohirwe omu maisho g'abanyamurwa abakuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka Saulo yaayeyongyera kutunga amaani, yaakwatsa enshoni Abayudaaya abaabaire batwire Damasiko, naahamiza kimwe ku Yesu ari Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
